import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="How Many Rakats in Each Prayer? Fajr to Isha" description="The fard rakats in each daily prayer: Fajr 2, Dhuhr 4, Asr 4, Maghrib 3, Isha 4, or 17 a day, plus the sunnah prayers commonly added, which differ by school." crumbs={[['Rakats in each prayer']]}>
  <h1>How many rakats are in each prayer?</h1>
  <p class="hl">The five daily prayers have <strong>17 obligatory (fard) rakats</strong>: Fajr 2, Dhuhr 4, Asr 4, Maghrib 3 and Isha 4.</p>
  <div class="tbl"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Prayer</th><th class="n">Fard rakats</th><th>Sunnah commonly prayed</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><a href="/fajr-time/">Fajr</a></td><td class="n">2</td><td style="white-space:normal">2 before</td></tr>
      <tr><td><a href="/dhuhr-time/">Dhuhr</a></td><td class="n">4</td><td style="white-space:normal">2 or 4 before, 2 after</td></tr>
      <tr><td><a href="/asr-time/">Asr</a></td><td class="n">4</td><td style="white-space:normal">Optional 4 before</td></tr>
      <tr><td><a href="/maghrib-time/">Maghrib</a></td><td class="n">3</td><td style="white-space:normal">2 after</td></tr>
      <tr><td><a href="/isha-time/">Isha</a></td><td class="n">4</td><td style="white-space:normal">2 after, then Witr (1 or 3, depending on school)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <p>The fard counts are agreed across the schools of Islamic law. The sunnah counts vary between schools and scholars, so treat that column as a common pattern. For a ruling on your own practice, ask a scholar or imam you trust.</p>
  <p>Jumu'ah on Friday has 2 fard rakats and takes the place of Dhuhr when prayed in congregation.</p>
  <p><a href="/cities/">Find today's prayer times for your city</a>.</p>
</Base>
